    "reviewTitle": "3 Years and STILL GOING STRONG!!",
    "reviewDescription": "These are by far the sturdiest and most long-lasting earbuds I have had. I use them daily during my commute to work and while studying at night. Despite wearing them all the time, they are very comfy because of the wide range of ear tip options. After 3 years, I would expect some quality drop in terms of sound and charge. HOWEVER! The full charge still lasts me about 10 days which is impressive given how often I listen to music. Also a note about waterproof capabilities: it is fantastic! I do high impact (sweaty) work outs and also wear these when I’m walking the dog in the rain — these have yet to fail me so far!! I even got another pair for my friend and my partner is addicted to their sleep mask. Fab brand with a loyal customer!!",
